*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*PSVersion: "(3010) 1"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*Manufacturer: "agentic-pdf"
*ModelName: "Agentic PDF Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Agentic PDF Printer"
*NickName: "Agentic PDF Printer (agent-readable layer embedded)"
*PCFileName: "AGENTIC.PPD"
*Product: "(Agentic PDF Printer)"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*VariablePaperSize: True
*Throughput: "1"
*FreeVM: "32000000"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.04 841.88]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Source: PickOne
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.04 841.88]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595.04 841.88"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.04 841.88"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"

*% Pass the PDF spool through untouched: the agentic-pdf backend
*% consumes PDFs directly. Other input formats are converted to PDF
*% by the standard CUPS filter chain before reaching this point.
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"
